[00:00.00] 作词 : Bastian Langebæk/Max Wolfgang/Olivia Dean
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Bastian Langebæk/Max Wolfgang/Olivia Dean
[00:15.41]I’ve seen it last for thirty years
[00:15.41]延续三十载春秋的美满 我是见证者
[00:18.54]Seen it bloom then end in tears
[00:18.54]绽放后以泪收场的结局 我也见过
[00:20.84]I’ve seen it after school and in the park
[00:20.84]在放学后的公园 见过其踪迹
[00:25.99]Sat right across me on the tube
[00:25.99]地铁车厢里坐在我对面的身影
[00:28.79]I’ve seen it miss a stop or two
[00:28.79]我见过 一两站路的错过
[00:31.37]I’ve seen it trying not to fall apart
[00:31.37]我见过 不让自己破碎的倔强
[00:36.66]I’ve heard it laced in every song
[00:36.66]每首歌里 都听过其回响
[00:39.26]And still the words all come out wrong
[00:39.26]但言语难免词不达意
[00:41.94]It doesn’t always answer when you call
[00:41.94]呼唤时未必得到回应
[00:47.10]Brings out the worst
[00:47.10]激发出最不堪的一面
[00:48.44]Brings out the best
[00:48.44]也催生最美好的部分
[00:49.82]I understand it less and less
[00:49.82]我却越来越难以理解
[00:52.45]I guess I’m not supposed to know it all
[00:52.45]或许本就不该妄图参透全部
[00:56.55]I've seen it dance with friends around the table
[00:56.55]见过 随友人在桌边起舞的微妙
[01:01.67]In Eleanor, Rosie and Louise
[01:01.67]在Eleanor Rosie与Louise之间流转
[01:06.86]And it makes me cry to think that I am able
[01:06.86]想到自己能以同样方式回馈
[01:12.32]To give it back the way it gives to me
[01:12.32]不禁潸然泪下
[01:18.87]I’ve seen it grow old and forget
[01:18.87]见过 随岁月老去的遗忘
[01:21.58]Until it’s just a silhouette
[01:21.58]直至化为朦胧剪影
[01:24.04]Till someone picks it up and sends it on
[01:24.04]直到有人拾起 传递下去
[01:29.47]I’ve seen the films
[01:29.47]看过相关电影
[01:30.63]I’ve read the books
[01:30.63]读过无数书籍
[01:32.04]My mum and dad, they got me hooked
[01:32.04]父母让我对此沉迷
[01:34.65]The fairytale, the search goes on and on
[01:34.65]童话般的追寻永无止境
[01:39.78]The more you look
[01:39.78]越是寻觅
[01:41.13]The more you find
[01:41.13]越是发现
[01:42.71]It’s all around you all the time
[01:42.71]爱 始终环绕在你周围
[01:45.09]Catches your eye, you blink and then it’s gone
[01:45.09]眨眼瞬间便从视野消失
[01:50.37]Brings out the worst
[01:50.37]激发出最不堪的一面
[01:51.73]Brings out the best
[01:51.73]也催生最美好的部分
[01:53.07]I know it’s somewhere in my chest
[01:53.07]我知道 爱就在胸腔某处
[01:55.83]I guess it’s been inside me all along
[01:55.83]原来 爱一直栖息在我心底
